    <briefdescription>
<para>DCS (Device Control <ref refid="classString" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">String</ref>) and APC (Application Program Command) passthrough. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This translation unit implements <computeroutput>Video::storeDCSHeader()</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>Video::applyDCSPayload()</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>Video::applyAPCPayload()</computeroutput>, and <computeroutput>Video::advanceCursorForImage()</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>ESC-level dispatch lives in <computeroutput><ref refid="_video_e_s_c_8cpp" kindref="compound">VideoESC.cpp</ref></computeroutput>; OSC dispatch lives in <computeroutput><ref refid="_video_o_s_c_8cpp" kindref="compound">VideoOSC.cpp</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>DCS passthrough</title><para>DCS (Device Control <ref refid="classString" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">String</ref>) sequences are accepted by the VT command processor and accumulated in <computeroutput>dcsBuffer</computeroutput> via <computeroutput>appendToBuffer()</computeroutput>. <computeroutput>dcsHook()</computeroutput> is the entry point and <computeroutput>dcsUnhook()</computeroutput> is the exit point. <computeroutput>Video::applyDCSPayload()</computeroutput> stores the DCS final byte (via <computeroutput>storeDCSHeader()</computeroutput>) and fires <computeroutput>id::dcsPayloadComplete</computeroutput> through the events map. The Processor handler delegates to <computeroutput>Skit::processDCS()</computeroutput>.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>APC passthrough</title><para>APC (Application Program Command) sequences are accumulated in <computeroutput>apcBuffer</computeroutput>. <computeroutput>Video::applyAPCPayload()</computeroutput> fires <computeroutput>id::apcPayloadComplete</computeroutput> through the events map. The Processor handler delegates to <computeroutput>Skit::processAPC()</computeroutput>.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Image pipeline</title><para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Video stores DCS final byte in <computeroutput>storeDCSHeader()</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Parser calls <computeroutput>video.applyDCSPayload()</computeroutput> — fires <computeroutput>id::dcsPayloadComplete</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Processor event handler calls <computeroutput>skit.processDCS(video.getDcsFinalByte(), ...)</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Processor event handler calls <computeroutput>video.advanceCursorForImage(skit.getLastImageRows())</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Thread model</title><para>All functions in this file run exclusively on the <bold>READER THREAD</bold>.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_video_8h" kindref="compound">Video.h</ref> — class declaration and full API documentation </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_skit_8h" kindref="compound">Skit.h</ref> — image decode and SKiT filepath handler </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_video_e_s_c_8cpp" kindref="compound">VideoESC.cpp</ref> — ESC sequence dispatch </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_video_o_s_c_8cpp" kindref="compound">VideoOSC.cpp</ref> — OSC sequence dispatch </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
